    tf: ["Conflict in the church means that God is not at work.", false, "Even in the early church, disputes occurred and were worked through."],
    sa: ["How should believers handle conflict in church and at work?", ["peace", "direct", "unity", "integrity", "gossip", "witness"], "A good answer says believers address issues early and directly, avoid gossip, choose their battles, seek wise mediation, pursue peace so far as possible and let their conduct honour Christ."],
